--><rss xmlns:sparkle="http://www.andymatuschak.org/xml-namespaces/sparkle" version="2.0"><channel><title>AndroidADBTool 更新</title><language>zh-CN</language><item><title>AndroidADBTool 1.0.18</title><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:09:23 GMT</pubDate><sparkle:version>20261123195648</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.18</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>11.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;测试环境新增科学上网：点网站链接或粘贴订阅后选择国家，手机流量经 USB 转到本机线路；已经开着时可以直接换国家。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;手机浏览器打不开核对页时不算连上，会写明还不能确认国家；状态栏图标只表示转发开着。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;新增找手机，可按类型、品牌、系统、状态和型号查找测试机，并看到现在插在哪台电脑。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;常用功能增加布局边界、进系统设置和进开发者模式；应用相关增加埋点调试、进应用设置和所有文件访问。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;系统相关改为设备概况，可复制品牌型号、系统版本、分辨率等信息；文件管理支持 SD 卡。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/zj-kechangjie/android_tool_plus-updates/releases/download/v1.0.18/AndroidADBTool-1.0.18-20261123195648-AppleSilicon.zip" length="53058609" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="QLLgHW+KvIPzioeYnTZ/uYE/1uBCc2wcljbWDYRni4EO31p8kkvuJxeO+5iYee37Pj5fBcRzux00qJDHMCERAA=="></enclosure><sparkle:deltas><enclosure url="https://github.com/zj-kechangjie/android_tool_plus-updates/releases/download/v1.0.18/AndroidADBTool-1.0.18-20261123195648-from-20261119095720-AppleSilicon.delta" length="15865254" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:deltaFrom="20261119095720" sparkle:edSignature="LGnNlV74GcVXbvTjTcNKeNMzWnxByYgo7PcNeKLlk8Uf0+PBq6uf/j/Z3hD9yC/DPxH9ynB/lSju0jzsTB8fCw==" sparkle:deltaFromSparkleExecutableSize="977616" sparkle:deltaFromSparkleLocales="Base,ar,ca,cs,da,de,el,es,fa,fi,fr,he,hr,hu,is,it,ja,ko,nb,nl,nn,pl,pt-BR,pt-PT,ro,ru,sk,sl,sv,th,tr,uk,vi,zh_CN,zh_HK,zh_TW"></enclosure><enclosure url="https://gi